msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.name"
msgstr "Teddy Bear"

msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.slot.soft_filling"
msgstr "Something Soft Inside"

msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.slot.toy_shape"
msgstr "Something Toy-like"

msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.slot.calm"
msgstr "Something to Quiet It"

msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.preview.childhood"
msgstr "It knows the bedroom you forgot."

msgid "slot.recipe.teddy.preview.comfort"
msgstr "It will not ask why you are still awake."

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.name"
msgstr "Pocket Night-talk Radio"

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.slot.sound"
msgstr "A Piece of Sound"

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.slot.shell"
msgstr "A Casing"

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.slot.tuning"
msgstr "A Way to Tune It"

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.preview.clear"
msgstr "A steady frequency, like a street that refuses to sleep."

msgid "slot.recipe.night_radio.preview.tide"
msgstr "As the dial crosses the blank, the tide answers."

msgid "slot.wish.hungry.result.fast_warm_milk"
msgstr "A skin cools around the rim of the milk. You decide this counts as a midnight snack."

msgid "slot.wish.hungry.result.fast_hash_brown"
msgstr "The crunch is clearer than the radio announcing the hour."

msgid "slot.wish.bedside.result.flower_sunflower"
msgstr "The flower turns to the ceiling lamp, mistaking it for the sun."

msgid "slot.wish.bedside.result.flower_lavender_sachet"
msgstr "A small purple patch of breathing quiet settles beside the pillow."

msgid "slot.wish.bedside.result.flower_night_jasmine"
msgstr "Only after lights-out does the fragrance slowly find its shape."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.book_bedtime_clipping"
msgstr "The old date on white paper wakes you more thoroughly than coffee."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.book_aquarium_issue"
msgstr "Distorted blue photographs cover the wall. The fish keep swimming forward."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.record_fluorescent_single"
msgstr "The beat leaves the last train running inside your body."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.flower_sunflower"
msgstr "It keeps facing the light. For now, you decide to do the same."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.flower_night_jasmine"
msgstr "Its fragrance makes the room deeper than it is. Sleep cannot find the door."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.toy_glass_marble"
msgstr "The marble crosses the desk, and the room briefly gains a second moon."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.toy_windup_moth"
msgstr "It circles the desk lamp again and again, never asking the time."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.craft_childhood_teddy"
msgstr "It remembers how you used to pretend you were not tired."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.craft_clear_receiver"
msgstr "Every frequency is awake, so you remain awake too."

msgid "slot.wish.stay_awake.result.craft_tide_receiver"
msgstr "There is surf in the empty band. You wait for it to recede."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.book_bedtime_clipping"
msgstr "The story has no ending. The shopping date on the back is still there."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.record_lullaby_cassette"
msgstr "Someone coughs softly on the tape. It does not sound like part of the recording."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.record_fluorescent_single"
msgstr "You remember a dance hall with a new name, and a night you never attended."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.toy_glass_marble"
msgstr "Light is trapped in the glass like a school recess with no way out."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.toy_windup_moth"
msgstr "Its gears sound like a childhood toy you broke, then secretly put back together."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.craft_childhood_teddy"
msgstr "Its worn patches are exactly where your memory left them."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.craft_comfort_bear"
msgstr "You do not remember owning it, but your body remembers how to hold it."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.craft_clear_receiver"
msgstr "An old station speaks this city's long-retired area code."

msgid "slot.wish.remember.result.craft_tide_receiver"
msgstr "The sea remembers something you never told anyone."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.record_lullaby_cassette"
msgstr "The tape runs a little slow, and the singer agrees to linger."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.flower_lavender_sachet"
msgstr "You fold the day small and tuck it into a seam of purple fragrance."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.flower_night_jasmine"
msgstr "Fragrance hangs from the sill, drawing another curtain across the room."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.fast_warm_milk"
msgstr "The cup warms your palms. The city's noise retreats a long way."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.craft_comfort_bear"
msgstr "It has no heartbeat, but your breathing slowly falls into step with it."

msgid "slot.wish.settle_down.result.craft_tide_receiver"
msgstr "Each burst of static breaks like foam. Afterward, only night remains."

msgid "slot.wish.rain_close.result.flower_lavender_sachet"
msgstr "The rain continues, but it is sealed beyond something soft and purple."

msgid "slot.wish.rain_close.result.toy_cloth_scraps"
msgstr "You bury your hands in them, sheltering inside a toy not yet finished."

msgid "slot.wish.rain_close.result.fast_warm_milk"
msgstr "The window is cold and the cup is warm. Tonight, that is enough."

msgid "slot.wish.rain_close.result.craft_childhood_teddy"
msgstr "It watches the rain for you, with a practiced posture that hurts to see."

msgid "slot.wish.rain_close.result.craft_comfort_bear"
msgstr "Its plush body absorbs the rain until only a distant echo remains."

